JavaScript / jQuery HTML Elements:


#) Set Text Content:
    - Set the inner text of an HTML element:

    1️⃣ jQuery:

        <h2>Setting Text Content</h2>
        <p id="01">Hello Earth!</p>
        <p id="02">Hello World!</p>

        <script>
            $(document).ready(function() {
                var myElement = $("#01"); 👈
                myElement.text("Hello Nepal!"); 👈
            });
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello Nepal!
                Hello World!
    
    2️⃣ JavaScript:

        <h2>Setting Text Content</h2>
        <p id="01">Hello Earth!</p>
        <p id="02">Hello World!</p>

        <script>
            const myElement = document.getElementById("01"); 👈
            myElement.textContent = "Hello Nepal!"; 👈
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello Nepal!
                Hello World!



#) Get Text Content:
    - Get the inner text of an HTML element:

    1️⃣ jQuery:

        <h2>Get Text Content</h2>
        <p id="01">Hello World!</p>
        <p id="02">Hello Nepal!</p>
        <p id="03">Hello Japan!</p>

        <p id="demo"></p>

        <script>
            $(document).ready(function() {
                var myText = $("#02").text(); 👈
                $("#demo").text(myText);  👈
            });
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello World!
                Hello Nepal!
                Hello Japan!
                Hello Nepal!
    
    2️⃣ JavaScript:

        <h2>Get Text Content</h2>
        <p id="01">Hello World!</p>
        <p id="02">Hello Nepal!</p>
        <p id="03">Hello Japan!</p>

        <p id="demo"></p>

        <script>
            const myText = document.getElementById("02").textContent; 👈
            document.getElementById("demo").innerHTML = myText; 👈
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello World!
                Hello Nepal!
                Hello Japan!
                Hello Nepal!


#) Set HTML Content:
    - Set the HTML content of an element:

    1️⃣ jQuery:

        <h2>Set HTML</h2>
        <div id="01"><p>Hello World!</p></div>
        <div id="02"><p>Hello Nepal!</p></div>

        <p id="demo"></p>

        <script>
            $(document).ready(function() {
                $("#02").html("<p>Hello World!</p>"); 👈
            });
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello World!
                Hello World!
    
    2️⃣ JavaScript:

        <h2>Set HTML</h2>
        <div id="01"><p>Hello World!</p></div>
        <div id="02"><p>Hello Nepal!</p></div>

        <p id="demo"></p>

        <script>
            document.getElementById("02").innerHTML = "<p>Hello World!</p>"; 👈
        </script>

        o/p:    Hello World!
                Hello World!


